{"task_id": "Mbpp/14", "solution": "def find_Volume(base: float, height: float, length: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the volume of a triangular prism using the formula:\n    (0.5 * base * height) * length.\n    \"\"\"\n    area_of_triangle = 0.5 * base * height\n    volume = area_of_triangle * length\n    return volume"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given integer is a Woodall number.\"\"\"\n    if number <= 0:\n        return False\n\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        # Calculate candidate Woodall number for the current n\n        candidate = n * (2**n) - 1\n\n        if candidate == number:\n            return True\n        elif candidate > number:\n            # If the candidate exceeds the number, it's not a Woodall number\n            return False\n        \n        n += 1"}
