{"task_id": "Mbpp/87", "solution": "from typing import TypeVar, Dict\n\nKeyType = TypeVar('KeyType')\nValueType = TypeVar('ValueType')\n\ndef merge_dictionaries_three(\n    dict1: Dict[KeyType, ValueType],\n    dict2: Dict[KeyType, ValueType],\n    dict3: Dict[KeyType, ValueType]\n) -> Dict[KeyType, ValueType]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges three dictionaries into a single dictionary.\n    For duplicate keys, the value from the last dictionary in the input sequence takes precedence.\n    \"\"\"\n    merged_dict = {}\n    merged_dict.update(dict1)\n    merged_dict.update(dict2)\n    merged_dict.update(dict3)\n    return merged_dict"}
