{"task_id": "Mbpp/104", "solution": "def sort_sublists(list_of_lists: list[list[str]]) -> list[list[str]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts each sublist of strings in a given list of lists.\n    Returns a new list of lists with each sublist's string elements sorted alphabetically.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_outer_list = []\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        sorted_sublist = sorted(sublist)\n        sorted_outer_list.append(sorted_sublist)\n    return sorted_outer_list"}
