{"task_id": "Mbpp/237", "solution": "def check_occurences(input_list: list[tuple]) -> dict[tuple, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of normalized tuples in a list, where normalization involves sorting elements within each tuple.\n    Returns a dictionary mapping unique normalized tuples to their counts.\n    \"\"\"\n    occurrences = {}\n    for original_tuple in input_list:\n        # Normalize the tuple by sorting its elements\n        normalized_elements = sorted(original_tuple)\n        normalized_tuple = tuple(normalized_elements)\n\n        # Increment the count for the normalized tuple\n        occurrences[normalized_tuple] = occurrences.get(normalized_tuple, 0) + 1\n    return occurrences"}
