{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "import math\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    This function utilizes helper functions for input validation and binomial coefficient calculation.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _validate_input(val: int) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Ensures the input n is a positive integer.\"\"\"\n        if not isinstance(val, int) or val <= 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    def _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n_val: int, k_val: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Computes the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n        return math.comb(n_val, k_val)\n\n    _validate_input(n)\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):  # Iterate for even k: 0, 2, 4, ...\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    \n    return total_sum"}
