{"task_id": "Mbpp/294", "solution": "def _is_numerical(element: any) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given element is an integer or a float.\"\"\"\n    return isinstance(element, (int, float))\n\ndef max_val(input_list: list) -> int | float | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies and returns the maximum numerical value from a heterogeneous list.\n    Non-numerical elements are ignored. Returns None if the list is empty or contains no numerical values.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_value = None\n    for element in input_list:\n        if _is_numerical(element):\n            if max_value is None or element > max_value:\n                max_value = element\n    return max_value"}
