{"task_id": "Mbpp/301", "solution": "def dict_depth(input_dictionary: dict) -> int:\n    # Calculate the maximum nesting depth of the given dictionary.\n    # The depth is 1 plus the maximum depth of any nested dictionary value.\n    max_depth = 1\n    for value in input_dictionary.values():\n        if isinstance(value, dict):\n            max_depth = max(max_depth, 1 + dict_depth(value))\n    return max_depth"}
