{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the cube sum of the first 'n' even natural numbers.\n    Returns 0 if n is less than or equal to 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_number = 2 * i\n        total_sum += even_number ** 3\n    return total_sum"}
