{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...], tuple2: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]) -> tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of tuple elements in the given two tuples.\n    Each nested tuple's corresponding elements are multiplied.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_outer_list = []\n    for nested_tuple1, nested_tuple2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        result_inner_list = []\n        for elem1, elem2 in zip(nested_tuple1, nested_tuple2):\n            result_inner_list.append(elem1 * elem2)\n        result_outer_list.append(tuple(result_inner_list))\n    return tuple(result_outer_list)"}
