{"task_id": "Mbpp/463", "solution": "def max_subarray_product(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum product of a contiguous subarray within the given array.\n    Returns 0 if the input array is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not nums:\n        return 0\n\n    max_so_far = nums[0]\n    min_so_far = nums[0]\n    result = nums[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(nums)):\n        current_num = nums[i]\n\n        temp_max = max_so_far\n\n        max_so_far = max(current_num, current_num * temp_max, current_num * min_so_far)\n        min_so_far = min(current_num, current_num * temp_max, current_num * min_so_far)\n\n        result = max(result, max_so_far)\n\n    return result"}
