{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    It returns 0 for an input of 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    temp_number = number\n    while temp_number > 0:\n        total_sum += temp_number % 10\n        temp_number //= 10\n\n    return total_sum"}
