{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\n\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity: float, temperature: float) -> int:\n    # Calculates the wind chill index rounded up to the next integer.\n    # Uses the standard Canadian/US wind chill formula (V in km/h, T in Celsius).\n    raw_wind_chill = 13.12 + (0.6215 * temperature) - (11.37 * (wind_velocity**0.16)) + (0.3965 * temperature * (wind_velocity**0.16))\n    rounded_wind_chill = math.ceil(raw_wind_chill)\n    return int(rounded_wind_chill)"}
