{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(input_array: list, k_position: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the first k_position elements of the input_array in-place.\"\"\"\n    if k_position < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"k_position cannot be negative.\")\n    if k_position > len(input_array):\n        raise IndexError(\"k_position cannot be greater than the length of the array.\")\n\n    start = 0\n    end = k_position - 1\n\n    while start < end:\n        input_array[start], input_array[end] = input_array[end], input_array[start]\n        start += 1\n        end -= 1\n\n    return input_array"}
