{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Natural numbers are positive integers greater than zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    start = max(1, l)\n    end = r\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in range(start, end + 1):\n        if num % 2 != 0:\n            total_sum += num\n\n    return total_sum"}
